  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Native deployment is opt-in. PowerShell is not included; activation selects pwsh from PATH by default or accepts an explicit payload directory. ABI v2 adds explicit lease-only SecureString and PSCredential parameter adapters, typed secret results, bounded credential-result sinks, safe PowerShellSecret transfer APIs, bounded module declarations, and payload-owned PSSession helpers. Windows x64 is the current end-to-end validated runtime.",
